# TURSO_DATABASE_URL and TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN hold real credentials now that the
# app talks to a hosted Turso/libSQL database — they live in .env.local
# (gitignored), not here. This file is intentionally left without secrets.
#
# For pure local dev without a Turso account, @libsql/client also accepts a
# local file URL, e.g. in .env.local:
#   TURSO_DATABASE_URL="file:../../../data/app.db"
#   (leave TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN unset)
